n emergency glass  breaker bezel that can also double as a  blunt instrument for 33 the diablo ii is  a versatile yet not too crazy  self-defense weapon that you won't  regret carrying around with you saber 3  in 1 pepper spray a pepper spray is a  proven self-defense weapon the sabre  three-in-one pepper spray is an  excellent option for anyone seeking a  compact yet powerful can of pepper spray  to carry around for everyday use as it  is specifically designed to be used with  your existing keychain the saber comes  with a custom grip for better aim a  safety to prevent accidental discharge  and a quick release mechanism to quickly  detach it from your keychain when using  it in addition it contains an advanced  formula that includes cs tear gas  exposure to which can cause intense pain  in the eyes throat and nose plus the  spray also contains uv marking dye to  aid in suspect identification its 10  foot range is effective in self-defense  situations and the can is good for 25  bursts which is about 5 times more than  other brands this makes it perfect for  getting out of almost any sticky  situation with ease saber is an  industry-leading manufacturer of  defensive products and their pepper  sprays are used by law enforcement  officials all across the u.s so this 10  3 in 1 pepper spray is an absolute  must-have the fast strike whip the fast  strike self-defense whip is a small easy  to use weapon that can cause severe pain  when used correctly despite being  lightweight and compactly designed this  still delivers powerful force with its  flexible rubber coated steel cable from  afar or up close if you're lucky enough  for it to hit your opponent's  unprotected skin it can cause a lot of  damage the whip is malleable enough to  curl into your pocket the handle offers  plenty of grip thanks partly to how  similar they are aesthetically compared  to regular pocket knives it can fit  snugly into hands offering an excellent  balance without feeling too heavy on  eith